id: wrathful-compressed-oozaru
name: Compressed Oozaru
order: 1
slot: trait
# Its [Permanent] effects: they hold outside the Transformation too.
permanent: 1
description: >
  All the raw, explosive power of the mighty Oozaru, packed into your decidedly smaller form, has left you as quite the powerhouse.
text: >
  Compressed Oozaru: All the raw, explosive power of the mighty Oozaru, packed into your decidedly smaller form, has left you as quite the powerhouse.
  (1)-[Permanent]: This Transformation cannot be used in conjunction with any Transformation that has the Blutz Wave Aspect.
  (2)-[Passive]: Treat your Size Category as if it was G Size Categories larger for the sake of Punching Down.
  (3)-[1/Round]: You may spend 1 stack of Battle Born to use the Signature Technique Maneuver while in the Feral State. If that Signature Technique was a Super Signature, you may apply the Ascended Signature Advantage to it.
  (4)-[Graded]: Wrathful has 2 Grades. Each Wrathful Grade:
  • Has their own Stress Test Requirement.
  • Sets the AMB (Attribute Modifier Bonus) of Wrathful for the listed Attributes to the amount listed on the Grades table.
  • Applies additional Aspects.

---

# (1) Not with a Blutz Wave Transformation (said), (3) the Signature Technique Maneuver while Feral: the table's. (4) Its Grades: its file's
# grade lines.

# (2) Your Size Category G larger for Punching Down.
[passive, effect 2]
punchingDown.sizeSteps += $G;
